FINDINGS:
1. [MAJOR] tooling/vscode/extension.js:16 — activeFile returns any document's fsPath with no languageId/isUntitled/scheme guard and activate at line 43 runs it unconditionally — Ctrl+F5 via palette on a non-Redblue or unsaved untitled file runs `rb run` on the wrong path — check `editor.document.languageId === "redblue"` and `!editor.document.isUntitled` and show an error otherwise
2. [MAJOR] tooling/vscode/extension.js:35 — cwd built as `Uri.file(file).with({ path: file.replace(/[^/\\]+$/, "") })` feeds fsPath (Windows `C:\...` backslashes) into Uri.path (which must be `/C:/...` forward-slash) and yields empty path for bare/untitled names — use `vscode.Uri.joinPath(vscode.Uri.file(file), "..")` or `path.dirname`
3. [MAJOR] tooling/vscode/extension.js:28 — shellQuote emits POSIX `'\''` escaping unconditionally but the terminal on Windows is PowerShell/cmd where `'` escapes as `''`, so a path with a quote/space breaks out of quoting at line 37 `sendText` — use platform-aware quoting or avoid the shell
4. [MAJOR] tooling/vscode/snippets/redblue.json:63 — standalone `catch` snippet expands to a fragment that is only valid inside `try` per docs/GRAMMAR.md:302, so completion at a blank line inserts a parse error — the test admits this by wrapping it at tests/tooling_extension_test.rs:277 — drop the `catch` snippet or make it a full try/catch template
5. [MAJOR] tests/tooling_extension_test.rs:425 — registration check is only `source.contains(registerCommand("..."))`, so a syntactically broken extension.js that never loads still passes and no `node --check` ever parses extension.js — add a JS syntax/load check
6. [MINOR] tooling/vscode/extension.js:32 — run creates a new terminal per invocation and never reuses or disposes it, so repeated Ctrl+F5 accumulates unbounded terminals — reuse a single terminal
7. [MINOR] tests/tooling_extension_test.rs:189 — duplicate_ids only compares `entry["command"]`, so two different commands colliding on the same key pass undetected while one command legitimately bound to two keys is flagged — check key duplication for keybindings
